{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I was in a forest before I was in the city. Before that, I lived in the Feywild. I used to be a fey, before that damned hag cursed me with this.\" she says, as she puts her hair up in a ponytail, revealing the 'living crown' marking her as a hexblood.","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:50:56.084000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T18:52:59.119000Z","id":"865304444232663069","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Oh my, I take it many deals had to be navigated? You're no stranger to their trickiness. I never give any of the ones in Ferrytown my name because of it\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:52:35.858000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865304862714626088","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Good thinking. I should probably do that as well.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:54:17.342000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865305288369242153","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
