{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"Nolan stands in front of the library, amazed to see it repaired.","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:56:41.097000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T19:09:14.899000Z","id":"865305891322593361","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"It brings back bad memories. That's why I keep it hidden.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:57:08.717000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865306007167827988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"As good a reason as any\" he whispers.\nHe waves and smiles at Nolan upon their entrance","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:57:32.008000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T18:59:22.393000Z","id":"865306104858542080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"He waves back, making a beeline for Midask and Evelyn. “Hel-lo again…”","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:58:44.580000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865306409246654464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Is that... oh no. Nolan, I'm so sorry. If I knew this would happen, I would have helped you back in Hampstead.\" Evelyn starts tearing up.","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:59:25.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865306579892437002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"(could you describe how Nolan looks for us?)","created_at":"2021-07-15T18:59:57.989000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865306717146316820","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"As you look at him, you see that his skin is stony grey and slightly rough. His appearance is much more resembling a gargoyle than a gnome, down to batlike ears and nose and small, useless wings. His right arm hangs limply at his side, cracked and even missing pieces. However, he is smiling. (Finn you would have seen him like this last night at the battle, although he wasn’t smiling then)","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:01:38.592000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T19:02:03.097000Z","id":"865307139106930749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"How are you feeling after last night?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:02:28.902000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865307350122102854","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"“Mm… bet-ter… felt use-less. So I leave… to work on im-proving. I am… having pro-gress. Glad you live.”","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:03:36.703000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865307634500763680","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"“It is… okay. I feel… bet-ter than… when we last speak… inside.”","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:04:03.659000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865307747561766932","reply_to_id":"865306579892437002","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"It takes more than an 18 ton Hydra goose to keep me down\" He winks\n\n\"You were a great help there though, I'm glad you were with us\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:04:40.527000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865307902196318209","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I... am... still.. sorry...\" she says through tears.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:05:07.331000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308014621753384","reply_to_id":"865307747561766932","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I'm not sure if you saw me there, because all I did was wave a flag, tell some jokes that didn't land, and then get knocked out for the fight!\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:06:04.340000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308253733781545","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"He gives her a small smile. “You are… good friend. To wor-ry.” \nTo Finn, he says  “You… in-spire.”","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:06:49.678000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308443895267389","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Well, I do try, but honestly, it's everyone else that keeps fighting that inspires me to carry on\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:07:23.174000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308584388329503","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I'm sorry I wasn't able to make it, I would have helped if I could.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:07:30.129000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308613558927360","reply_to_id":"865308253733781545","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"It's alright, I know you would have if you could make it there in time. You have been a great help on many other occasions\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:07:54.963000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308717720272907","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Thank you for calling me your friend.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:08:04.411000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308757349236786","reply_to_id":"865308443895267389","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"“Do… we have… li-brar-i-an back?”","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:08:57.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865308978313429032","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Those lich-brarians won't go anywhere, even in the case of being bombed.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:09:37.785000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865309148988047421","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Lich?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:09:57.629000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865309232220078080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"“I wish… to bor…row… a book.”","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:10:11.932000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865309292210290776","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Yep, undying servitude as librarians here in the EC.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:10:30.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865309369151520828","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"“Be…fore I… go in-to si-lent zone… Can I ask quest-ion Mi-dask?”","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:11:49.352000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865309700818862080","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Why of course!\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:12:07.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865309775831236608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"“… how can… I help… our cause more? I wish… to com-mit in more than ti-tle.” He lowers his voice.","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:12:48.114000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-15T19:12:55.749000Z","id":"865309947285995520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
