{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Well to start, bring more people into the fold. It seem I've also been collecting a large group that quarters themselves in my ship. All supportive to the cause are welcome to bunk and stay there, I have room for I think 9 or 10 more people, and afterwards it will just be another 500 gold investment to house 12 more.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:15:03.923000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865310516908916747","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"He whispers even quieter","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:15:14.679000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865310562024030249","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I have my people working on a project to arm our people the next time we need a fight\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:15:35.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865310647343644703","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Well, regular crew quarters are actually quite cheap.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:15:43.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865310682233045002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"They are, but they take up space. Redcoats can't enter a quarters they can't find\" He winks","created_at":"2021-07-15T19:16:04.978000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865310772993327114","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
